    <string name="placement_title">Where to place the phone</string>
    <string name="placement_text">• Put the phone on the bedside table or the mattress next to your pillow, on a stable surface.
• Keep it connected to a charger.
• Do not cover the microphone when sound tracking is on.
• The phone does not need to be under your pillow.
• Ideally you sleep alone in the bed – a partner\'s movements and sounds are counted too.</string>
